   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The logical validation of a conclusion",
     "texto": [
      "In the drafting of expert reports and academic essays it is not enough to juxtapose facts; it is essential to verify whether the deduction (**Schlussfolgerung**) follows necessarily from the premises (**Prämissen**) formulated: **Aus den vorliegenden Daten lässt sich keineswegs ableiten, dass die Strategie gescheitert sei** (From the available data it can by no means be deduced that the strategy has failed)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Lexical resources for weighing conclusive validity",
     "texto": [
      "To question hasty conclusions, expressions of epistemic distance are used: **voreilige Schlüsse ziehen** (to draw hasty conclusions), **auf lückenhaften Annahmen beruhen** (to rest on incomplete assumptions) and **den Kausalzusammenhang belegen** (to demonstrate the cause-effect relation)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Analytical indicator",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Critical function",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example in expert reports",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "voreiliger Schluss",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Objection to a hasty induction",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Das wäre ein voreiliger Schluss.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "sich ableiten lassen",
